Subject: [PATCH v3] media: usb: siano: don't set URB_FREE_BUFFER flag
X-Virus-Status: clean
X-Anti-Virus-Server: fsav312.rs.sakura.ne.jp
X-LSpam-Score: -5.3 (-----)
X-LSpam-Report: No,
